{"agent":"lane-coord","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":3,"detail":"`running` takes an injected `now` and uses it for suite `age_s`, but the waiter count compares that same `now` to each ticket's filesystem `st_mtime`. Given `now=1_700_000_000`, `suite_queue_stale_s=60`, and a `*.ticket` whose `st_mtime` is `1_700_000_100`, `at - mtime` is `-100`, `-100 <= 60` is true, and `queued` becomes 1 even though the ticket is not a waiter observed at the supplied clock. The inverse (`now` ahead of wall mtime) drops live tickets. Any caller that freezes `now` (the parameter exists for that) gets a wrong queued count while suite ages still look coherent.","digest":"1e0e8a1f72b02b0a","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/suitelock.py:running","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/suitelock.py:running"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"The new assertion does not fail on the unfixed comparison, so it does not lock the bug it claims to cover. With `now=1_000.0` and a ticket just written (st_mtime near wall time, ~1.7e9), the old expression `at - st_mtime <= stale` is a large negative and still true, so `running(...)[1]` is already 1 and the test passes without the `CLOCK.wall()` change. The input that actually diverges is the other direction: `now` far ahead of wall mtime (for example `now=1_800_000_000`, live ticket mtime ≈ wall, `suite_queue_stale_s=60`) makes unfixed code drop the waiter (`queued == 0`) while the fixed line keeps it. That case is never asserted.","digest":"84e8519e1f574155","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_lanes_coordinator.py:test_the_queued_count_ignores_an_injected_now","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_lanes_coordinator.py:test_the_queued_count_ignores_an_injected_now"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"The prior defect is unchanged: this delta only rewrites the coordinator test clock from `now=1_000.0` to `now=4_000_000_000.0` and never touches `running`. Waiter freshness is still `injected now` versus each ticket's wall `st_mtime`. Given `now=1_700_000_000`, `suite_queue_stale_s=60`, and a `*.ticket` with `st_mtime=1_700_000_100`, `now - mtime` is `-100`, `-100 <= 60` is true, and `queued` is 1 for a ticket that is not a waiter at the supplied clock; `now` ahead of wall mtime still drops a live ticket. The new assertion does not alter that comparison, so it cannot be treated as fixed.","digest":"92cdbefb1b0c2663","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/suitelock.py:running","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/suitelock.py:running"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_findings":1,"delta_from":"fdab7d3b4935f9cc4dce7ce7e0bcee702930bec6","delta_raised":["92cdbefb1b0c2663"],"delta_rounds":2,"diff_chars":612,"diff_sha":"caa7e22e7364e7dcfcf63eccf8af878d1e44f27bc9aa9c37eeaf524bdfd42fbc","diff_source":"delta review of 1 commit since fdab7d3b49","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":57.4,"family":"xai","findings":3,"full_coverage":"4/4 chunk(s) reviewed","max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"a913b11218e334cf","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/CO-lanes-coordinator.critic.grok-4.7.20261111T215721Z-8889b592.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"delta","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"655d28ba91d39ae6bd1fd2b560ca688ec99caccc","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/lane_views.py":"100644 4ddde26df66907fa824841fca045bff71f50532f","ddflow/config_sections/lanes.py":"100644 8d97a71b801996816ec6c966b55a47da9a5fc2ef","ddflow/services/coordinator_view.py":"100644 48037d714e55614fbde60c90102a72625d293eb5","ddflow/services/suitelock.py":"100644 7d86d5eea8d4c672878664e48e4cdfd8901c56f8","ddflow/surfaces/declared/lanes.py":"100644 d2929308953a8b8dfbd0b68de6359826733103be","ddflow/surfaces/declared/lease_table.py":"100644 637f777b476428a9b6e32fe11554fdf5109221ec","ddflow/templates/prompts/help/lanes.md":"100644 33d4759ff6ec0